Description: avcodec/nvenc: submit stereo frame packing in the SEI payload array
 .
 Put the mandatory frame packing payload first so the HEVC 512-byte SEI
 budget cannot discard it. Follow the configured and forced keyframe
 cadence, and submit temporal identity for every frame. Add a default-on
 frame_packing option following the existing SEI option conventions.
 .
 RTX 3060 tests cover all supported packings and orders, FFmpeg/mpv decode,
 B-frame temporal identity, forced IDR cadence and oversized unregistered
 SEI. HEVC constraints remain zero. Both plain 2D and explicitly disabled
 marked sources are byte-identical to the unpatched encoder.
 .
 Assisted-by: gpt-6-astra via Codex
